# Generated by Cargo
debug
target

# kan's local log/index/identity, if day is dogfooded in its own repo
.kan/

# day's disposable render cache: strictly derived from kan and git, written
# by the session-start hook so the status line can render without shelling
# kan. Delete it and lose nothing -- it regenerates, and nothing reads it to
# decide anything (docs/ROADMAP.md v0.6).
.day/

# rustfmt backups
**/*.rs.bk

*.pdb

# Worktrees other sessions create here. `git add -A` swept one into a commit
# once — as an embedded git repo, which a clone would silently not contain.
.claude/worktrees/
.DS_Store

# CPython bytecode from tests that import scripts/ as modules. Belt and
# braces: the test sets PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE, and this keeps a stray run
# from making the tree dirty — `cargo publish` refuses to publish a dirty tree,
# which failed a release once.
scripts/__pycache__/
__pycache__/
